Low-level synchronization is core to performance. Spinlocks teach memory ordering, cache behavior, and back-off strategies that frequent high-contention code paths must consider.

## Key Concepts
- atomic_flag and memory_order semantics
- back-off strategies and CPU pause hints
- cache-line alignment and false sharing
